red-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"2nd Wind Heating and Cooling &amp; Indoor Air Quality Team in Columbia\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team.jpg 1920w, /images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-4\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left mt-0 h-decorator--white h-decorator-md h-decorator\"><br>Comprehensive HVAC, Plumbing &amp; Home Generator Services in Camden, SC</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow pb-4 is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a2f35af1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Heating and Cooling in Camden</strong></h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Camden&#8217;s cooling season runs from April into October, and its winters, though short, deliver hard freezes most years. Our <a href=\"/services/cooling-columbia-sc\">cooling services</a> cover air conditioning repair, replacement, and maintenance, and our <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc\">heating services</a> cover furnaces, heat pumps, and dual fuel systems. Camden adds a wrinkle many Midlands towns lack: homes in and around the historic district carry older ductwork and equipment layouts, and rooms an original duct plan cannot reach are often best served by a <a href=\"/services/cooling-columbia-sc/mini-split\">ductless mini split</a> rather than a forced retrofit. Pollen, humidity, and closed-up rooms also make our <a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-columbia-sc\">indoor air quality services</a> relevant most of the year.</p>\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Plumbing and Drains in Camden</strong></h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A city with Camden&#8217;s history has plumbing spanning every era of material, from galvanized supply lines in older homes to modern PEX in new construction. Our licensed <a href=\"/services/plumbing-columbia-sc\">plumbing services</a> cover water heaters, fixtures, leaks, repiping, and gas lines, and our <a href=\"/services/drains-columbia-sc\">drain services</a> locate and correct clogs, root intrusion, and aging sewer lines with camera evidence before anything is dug.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Home Generators in Camden</strong></h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kershaw County takes its outages from summer thunderstorms and the occasional winter ice storm, and rural stretches can wait longer for restoration than the Columbia core. Our <a href=\"/services/home-generators-columbia-sc\">home generator services</a> size, install, and maintain standby units that start and transfer automatically.</p>\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How We Work in Camden</strong></h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The process is the same one we run everywhere: diagnose the cause, record video of the finding, and present options with prices before work begins. Cloud 10 members through our <a href=\"/maintenance\">maintenance plans</a> get seasonal tune-ups scheduled automatically and priority when Camden&#8217;s first heat wave fills the calendar.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-4\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs</h2>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can you work on HVAC systems in Camden&#8217;s older and historic homes?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yes. Older homes near downtown Camden often have ductwork and equipment placements that predate modern layouts, and our technicians size and route solutions to the house rather than forcing a standard install, including ductless options where ducts cannot go.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Do older Camden homes need special attention to their sewer lines?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Homes with original mid-century lines may have clay, cast iron, or fiber-based pipe near the end of its life. A camera inspection identifies the material and condition in one visit, which is worth doing before a backup makes the decision urgent.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How should Camden homeowners protect pipes before a hard freeze?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Insulate exposed crawl space runs, protect hose bibs, and drip faucets served by vulnerable lines when temperatures fall into the teens. We repair burst pipes when it is too late for prevention, and quote the protection alongside the fix.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Is the Cloud 10 Membership available to Camden homeowners?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yes. Camden members get the same two seasonal tune-ups, priority scheduling, and member pricing as the rest of our service area, with visits scheduled for you.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What other communities near Camden does 2nd Wind serve?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We also serve Lugoff and Elgin, both within about fifteen minutes of Camden, along with the broader Kershaw County area.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When a Camden home needs one of its systems fixed, the evidence should come before the invoice. Call 2nd Wind, schedule online, or use the 24/7 chat, and see the problem on video before you approve the work.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"our-promise container should-overlap \" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Two 2nd Wind Heating and Air Conditioning technicians reviewing items on a tablet device\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device.jpg 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Experts in HVAC, Plumbing &#038; Indoor Air Quality in Columbia and the Surrounding Midlands Region</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">For 2nd Wind HVAC in Columbia, SC, we prioritize a timely response to all customer inquiries and service requests, ensuring your comfort is never compromised. With our 24/7 emergency HVAC and plumbing services, we are always available to provide immediate assistance. Whether you need HVAC repair, plumbing solutions, or indoor air quality services, our team is dedicated to delivering fast, reliable support so you&#8217;re never left waiting when it matters most. Choose 2nd Wind HVAC for prompt, professional care in Columbia, SC.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5 has-grad-white-to-gray-gradient-background\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Certifications and Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 5;\" data-logo-count=\"5\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocarousel-arrow logocarousel-arrow--start\" aria-label=\"See previous\"><svg class=\"logocarousel-arrow-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg></button>\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:5;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE)\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png 252w, /images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE-150x150.png 150w\" /></div>                    </li>\n      